Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:14.70,3 primeiras partes de Yami Shibai,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC5E4F1&\2c&HC5E4F1&\3c&H18213A&\4c&H0B0F1A&\pos(964,948)\b1\i0\fs55}Scary Story
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the story of a college student \Nwho invited his junior to a part-time job...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot about our promise, senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what kind of job is this?   
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We just carry packed cardboard boxes\Nto the new location.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The pay is 50,000 yen, plus... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,a scary story, they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A scary story...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, right, senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.69,0:00:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That I'm forgetful and a huge scaredy-cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that manga-like personality trait?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weird guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:01:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it here...?\NSo you came after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.99,0:01:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm tight on cash this month...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.07,0:01:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of person is the client?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.95,0:01:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.03,0:01:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They only gave me contact info for reporting completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll finish this in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what made you such \Na big scaredy-cat in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well..
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.71,0:01:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,trauma from my childhood, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I did something bad, my old man
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,would always lock me in a pitch-black closet 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.91,0:01:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and tell me scary stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're locked in the dark for hours, 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.21,0:01:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you start feeling like \Nsomeone is right beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're trapped by that fear, 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.65,0:01:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you can never escape it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are you still in touch with your old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.71,0:01:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,th-this...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is definitely, definitely not normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we put the stuff inside, 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.87,0:02:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,we get paid, so just endure it a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The power isn't even on...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,UAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To answer your earlier question...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.10,0:02:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a normal relationship \Nwith my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,EH?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how many times I told him something \Nwas in the dark, he wouldn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So I made my father experience the exact same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I locked him away, 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,every night he enters my room 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and whispers in my ear:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I'm lonely"...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,, {\i1}"I'm lonely"...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought your mother and brother too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe, now you won't be lonely, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this part-time job...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it you who posted the job listing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I posted the listing for this job because \Nso many people don't believe my story, 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that, rent and moving costs \Nkeep piling up... \NI'm completely broke!   
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you... 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,besides your family...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm forgetful and a huge scaredy-cat, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,do you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HC5E4F1&\2c&HC5E4F1&\3c&H18213A&\4c&H0B0F1A&\b1\fs65}THE END
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,298)}Key Scene note: The episode revolves around a college student (senpai) helping his junior (kouhai) with a high-paying moving job. \NThe junior claims to be "a forgetful scaredy-cat" due to childhood trauma from his father locking him in dark closets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,704)}However, the horrific truth is revealed when they enter the dark house: the junior murdered his own father by locking him up, but his father's spirit returned, bringing the ghost of his mother and brother. Unable to handle the haunting, the junior keeps "moving" and posting fake job ads to trick victims into taking the cursed boxes containing his murdered/haunted family. \NThe junior's claims of being "forgetful" served as a creepy cover for how many other innocent people he has already sacrificed.
